@startuml
actor Пользователь
participant MainWindow
participant AppController
participant CommandHistory
participant "RemoveNodeCommand" as CMD
participant Circuit

Пользователь -> MainWindow: Ctrl+Z (или меню "Отмена")
MainWindow -> AppController: undo()
AppController -> CommandHistory: undo()
CommandHistory -> CMD: undo()
CMD -> Circuit: восстановить узел и связи
CMD --> CommandHistory: ok
CommandHistory --> AppController: true
AppController --> MainWindow: true
MainWindow -> MainWindow: перерисовать сцену
@enduml